WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.714
The smells came from the opposite direction.

2
00:00:03.715 --> 00:00:08.267
"We must turn this boat around," Dr. Dolittle stated.

3
00:00:08.268 --> 00:00:12.863
"Jip, are you sure?" said, Gub-Gub, sniffing.

4
00:00:12.864 --> 00:00:16.474
"I don’t smell anything."

5
00:00:16.475 --> 00:00:20.033
"That’s because you’re a pig!" barked Jip.

6
00:00:20.034 --> 00:00:25.098
"Pigs have a good sense of smell, too!" Gub-Gub said proudly.

7
00:00:25.099 --> 00:00:30.955
"I can smell coffee, biscuits, strawberry jam . . ."

8
00:00:30.956 --> 00:00:36.137
"You’re holding a biscuit . . . with strawberry jam!" Jip shouted.

9
00:00:36.138 --> 00:00:39.573
"And there’s coffee downstairs!"

10
00:00:39.574 --> 00:00:45.441
"Stop arguing! Let’s find the boy’s uncle!" Dr. Dolittle scolded.

11
00:00:45.442 --> 00:00:48.005
Jip continued to sniff the air.

12
00:00:48.006 --> 00:00:51.711
"We’re getting closer, Doctor," the dog said.

13
00:00:51.712 --> 00:00:53.530
"I’ll look from up here,"

14
00:00:53.531 --> 00:00:58.079
said Too-Too as he flew up to the mast.

15
00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:01.678
They sailed all day, but they saw no land anywhere.

16
00:01:01.679 --> 00:01:04.542
Even the boy began to lose hope.

17
00:01:04.543 --> 00:01:07.100
"Is Jip sure, Dr. Dolittle?

18
00:01:07.101 --> 00:01:10.820
Can you ask him again?" he asked.

19
00:01:10.821 --> 00:01:13.893
But Dr. Dolittle trusted his faithful dog.

20
00:01:13.894 --> 00:01:15.427
"I believe Jip.

21
00:01:15.428 --> 00:01:20.081
I’m sure he knows what he is doing," the doctor replied.

22
00:01:20.082 --> 00:01:24.985
Jip suddenly howled loudly.

23
00:01:24.986 --> 00:01:28.724
"What’s the matter, Jip?" asked the worried doctor.

24
00:01:28.725 --> 00:01:30.237
"We must hurry!

25
00:01:30.238 --> 00:01:35.659
The smell is getting weaker! Hurry!" Jip barked.

26
00:01:35.660 --> 00:01:38.955
Dr. Dolittle and the animals found some rope.

27
00:01:38.956 --> 00:01:42.294
They made it into thin strings again.

28
00:01:42.295 --> 00:01:44.933
Then the doctor called the birds.

29
00:01:44.934 --> 00:01:55.273
"This pirates’ ship is fast," he told them, "but we must go faster!"

30
00:01:55.274 --> 00:01:58.695
Just like before, the birds pulled the ship.

31
00:01:58.696 --> 00:02:01.225
It moved faster than ever.

32
00:02:01.226 --> 00:02:06.579
"I’m flying! I’m flying!" the boy shouted excitedly.

33
00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:10.744
"Jip! Jip!" Too-Too suddenly cried.

34
00:02:10.745 --> 00:02:13.834
"There’s an island ahead of us!"

35
00:02:13.835 --> 00:02:17.704
The island was small but it had a huge rock on it.

36
00:02:17.705 --> 00:02:22.540
"Let’s sail around the island first," suggested Dab-Dab.

37
00:02:22.541 --> 00:02:25.468
Dr. Dolittle thanked the birds for their help.

38
00:02:25.469 --> 00:02:29.353
Then he slowly guided the ship around the island.

39
00:02:29.354 --> 00:02:34.460
He could see no living creatures thereㅡno man, birds or animals.

40
00:02:34.461 --> 00:02:37.845
"Hello!" Dr. Dolittle called out.

41
00:02:37.846 --> 00:02:41.195
"Hello!" echoed the rock.

42
00:02:41.196 --> 00:02:44.942
Dr. Dolittle shook his head and looked at Jip.

43
00:02:44.943 --> 00:02:46.211
"But he’s here!

44
00:02:46.212 --> 00:02:49.568
I know it!" Jip said.

45
00:02:49.569 --> 00:02:51.809
So the doctor put down the anchor.

46
00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:53.968
Everyone got off the ship.

47
00:02:53.969 --> 00:02:58.173
Jip started to sniff the ground and walk toward the rock.

48
00:02:58.174 --> 00:03:02.091
"Do you think my uncle is here?" asked the boy.

49
00:03:02.092 --> 00:03:05.694
But Dr. Dolittle could not answer him.

50
00:03:05.695 --> 00:03:09.124
At last Jip let out a great bark.

51
00:03:09.125 --> 00:03:13.260
He stood beside a big deep hole in the middle of the rock.

52
00:03:13.261 --> 00:03:17.473
"Can you see anything?" the boy asked Dr. Dolittle.

53
00:03:17.474 --> 00:03:21.954
"I will go down and look," the brave doctor replied.

54
00:03:21.955 --> 00:03:24.887
It was very dark inside the hole.

55
00:03:24.888 --> 00:03:29.835
"It looks like a cave," Dr. Dolittle shouted out.

56
00:03:29.836 --> 00:03:33.910
"Do you see anything?" Dab-Dab called down.

57
00:03:33.911 --> 00:03:36.079
Dr. Dolittle lit a match.

58
00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:39.271
"I do!" said the doctor excitedly.

59
00:03:39.272 --> 00:03:46.551
There, in the corner of the cave, lay a man with red hair!

